* text=auto
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
LICENSE text eol=lf
# The Command Code adapter is TypeScript. Without an explicit rule, `* text=auto` lets the
# Windows runners check it out with CRLF (core.autocrlf=true), and a test that reads the
# source with a literal-\n pattern then cannot see guards that are present in the file.
*.ts text eol=lf
